  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BANANA ACCOMPANYING MEASURES 2012 allocation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The strategy will focus, in line with BAM objectives and NAS, on three specific objectives: increase the efficiency of banana production, so that the industry can continue to be a provider of jobs and wages for the population of Stann Creek and North Toledo districts; support economic and social development to give alternative opportunities to those segments of the population (especially the young generation) not interested in working in agriculture; and develop a stronger policy and institution</narrative>
  </description>
